    "description": "1409 Shotwell St, San Francisco, CA 94110 - Cross Street: Stoneman St\n**EMAIL FOR VIRTUAL TOUR**\nDESCRIPTION:\nA MUST-SEE Unit in Prime Bernal Heights Location Four Bedrooms on Two Levels with Private Deck overlooking Downtown SF. Steps to Bernal Heights Park and Precita Park. Two levels, two bedrooms plus one bathroom, kitchen and living room on main level and two bedrooms one bathroom downstairs. Walk out to private deck perfect for entertaining/BBQing! One car garage parking included, shared laundry in building.\nFEATURES:\n- 4 Bedrooms/2 Bathrooms\n- Large Open Kitchen Connected to Living Room with Views!\n- Dishwasher\n- Private Deck\n- Approx 1615 SqFt\nNEIGHBORHOOD:\n- 95 Walk Score (Daily Errands do not Require a Car)\n- 84 Transit Score: Close to major Transit including J-Church Line, Muni and 24th Street BART Station. Easy access to freeways I-280, HWY101\n- Short Walk to Bernal Heights Park, Precita Park, Cortland and Valencia Street\nLEASING TERMS\n- Beds/Baths: 4BD/2BA\n- Rent: $7,495.00\n- Deposit: One Months Rent\n- Available NOW\n*Pets to be considered\n*NO Smokers\nRENTAL TERMS\n- Parking: 1 Car Garage Parking Included\n- Yard:  Private Deck\n- Laundry:  Shared Laundry Entry Way (Free)\n- Tenants pay electricity, garbage, Cable/Internet\nPLEASE CONTACT\nBrendan Landeck |\nshow contact info\n| Laurel Realty | DRE# 01905168",
